purpose:
Journal-authoritative arena admission, compound execution and recovery.

Only ledger events establish completion. Runtime claims serialize invocations;
immutable output spools merely preserve untrusted command data between stages. declare validates the bench_declared shape, requires p0 below p1, rejects duplicate bench declarations as conflict or bad_op, admits the bank, and refuses retired subjects or unadmitted seats. run executes the cell plan under the per-operation claim lock with deterministic ar- child operation ids, staged and identity-checked runner output, memory preflight, a required current-run episode, then close and bench.result per cell. verdict aggregates only complete-task prefixes into observations, runs the declared SPRT bounds and credit rule, and refuses unfinished cells, unmatched grids, or finalized benchmarks.
